1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,809
Single file. Slow steps. Nobody runs.

2
00:00:04,359 --> 00:00:06,922
In... two... three... four.

3
00:00:08,959 --> 00:00:10,234
Ah... ah... ACHOO!

4
00:00:11,559 --> 00:00:13,771
That's not fear. That's a sneeze.

5
00:00:14,959 --> 00:00:17,324
Help me move them. Quietly.

6
00:00:18,159 --> 00:00:19,192
There are so many of them.

7
00:00:20,959 --> 00:00:23,119
Gus... I can't stop shaking.

8
00:00:24,159 --> 00:00:27,497
Look at me. In for four. Hold. Out for four.

9
00:00:29,159 --> 00:00:30,627
Name five things you can see.

10
00:00:30,907 --> 00:00:34,796
You. Teddy. Rosa. The baby.

11
00:00:35,076 --> 00:00:36,969
And one very calm carrot.

12
00:00:42,319 --> 00:00:46,715
Rule four: breathe in a box. And when you can, help someone else breathe.

13
00:00:49,319 --> 00:00:52,392
Thank you for shopping at Freshway. Have a nice day.
